<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - PaineWebber starts Genzyme.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - PaineWebber starts Genzyme.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- PaineWebber analyst Elise Wang initated coverage of Genzyme Corp with an attractive rating, a source at the brokerage said.</p>
<p>-- The analyst was not immediately available to comment.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street bureau, 212-859-1730</p>
